			written = { ["Riverpaw Gnolls and Scouts (level 11-13) roam the hills south of the coast, from above {area:111} east to the {area:916}. The gnolls further south and west are 13-19: stay in the north hills.\nMurloc Coastrunners and Raiders line the beach north of the mine. They flee at low health: pull one at a time.\nCareful: Gnolls that stand close together tend to join a fight as a group. Pulling one at a time is safer.\nCareful: Two Defias stand guard inside the house, one of them the level 15 named {npc:502}. They are linked, so attacking either one brings both."] = "Riverpaw Gnolls and Scouts (level 11-13) roam the hills south of the coast, from above Jangolode Mine east to the Jansen Stead. The gnolls further south and west are 13-19: stay in the north hills.\nMurloc Coastrunners and Raiders line the beach north of the mine. They flee at low health: pull one at a time.\nCareful: Gnolls that stand close together tend to join a fight as a group. Pulling one at a time is safer.\nCareful: Two Defias stand guard inside the house, one of them the level 15 named Benny Blaanco. They are linked, so attacking either one brings both.", ["South along the road, past the fork. {npc:233} stands outside, {npc:235} in the house, {npc:253395} in the barn to the west. Young Goretusks and Fleshrippers roam the fields around the farm: start on livers and the stew's meat on the way."] = "South along the road, past the fork. Farmer Saldean stands outside, Salma in the house, Ozwin Ironsprocket in the barn to the west. Young Goretusks and Fleshrippers roam the fields around the farm: start on livers and the stew's meat on the way." },
