					note = "Back to Ashlam in {area:3197}: he forges the {item:20620}. Look at the reward window before you hand in: Classic also offered the {item:20505}, the {item:20504} or the {item:20512}, and Forever's notes say that choice may be gone. Use the stone before a fight against undead ({area:2279}, {area:2057}): it lasts ten minutes and is gone after one use.",
