					},
				},
				{
					title = "The Spirit Stone",
					note = "The Spirit Stone stands on a snowy ridge north-west of {area:77}. The trail is easy to miss: it climbs the hill from the valley floor; at the small camp near the top turn left and the stone comes into view. Stand beside it, drink the {item:6635} and speak to the {npc:5891} before it fades.",
