					note = "{area:2577} lies in central {zone:1444}. From the gate at the foot of the ruins, walk up through the outer courtyards to the West wing's door at their north end; it needs a {item:18249} (from Pusillin in Dire Maul East) or a rogue's lockpicking. {npc:11489} (level 60 elite) stands at the far end of the West wing's first courtyard. Once attacked he calls every {npc:11459} still alive in the courtyard: kill them first. His death frees the {quest:7643}: talk to it to give it the horse feed and the {item:18753}, and it blesses the barding. A group of five at 60.",
