				{
					title = "{object:179746}",
					note = "{area:2057} lies under {area:2298}, the island town in the south-east of the {zone:1422}; the door needs the {item:13704} (The Key to {area:2057}). Clear the {object:179746}, Rattlegore's room in the basement, then use the {item:18746} at its centre. Four waves of spirits come, each ending with an Aspect: players judge them with {spell:1105}, Justice, Righteousness and then Light, which stuns them. {npc:14516} (level 62 elite) comes after the last; he mind-controls players. Loot the {item:18749}, use it inside the Ossuary to redeem it, and give it and the {item:18792} to {npc:14568}. If the group wipes, the gates lock and the scryer is gone: abandon the quest and take it again from Lord Grayson for a new satchel. A group of five at 60. Again Into the {object:179746}, after the mount, lets you fight him again.",
